  "description": "Recognition of stem files by name (Moises exports and hand-made files). Hub and leader both test against these cases. Rules: (1) only audio extensions count (mp3, m4a, wav, flac, ogg, aac); paths under __MACOSX/ and files starting with '.' are ignored (role null). (2) Normalize the base name without extension: lower case, accents removed, the characters _ - . ( ) [ ] replaced by spaces, spaces collapsed. (3) Find every keyword below as whole words; the match that ENDS LAST in the name wins (the stem name usually follows the song title); on a tie, the longer keyword wins. (4) No match: role 'unknown' (the user picks the role). Real Moises export names (2026-10-31): '<artist> - <title>_<stem>_mixed.mp3'.",
